置去重；原始錨點完整保留，頻次不代表來源權威度。","included_kinds":["paragraph","table_cell"],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[{"id":"a-jin057-volume-xiu-yun","subject_person_id":"wce_220_oey","object_person_id":"tks_yde_q8w","predicate":"father","qualifiers":{"source_term":"則子允"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-057","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-057-tao-huang","source_id":"s-jinshu-057-tao-huang-ws2413329","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-057-tao-huang:p003","quote":"初，霍弋之遣稷、炅等，與之誓曰：「若賊圍城未百日而降者，家屬誅；若過百日救兵不至，吾受其罪。」稷等守未百日，糧盡，乞降，璜不許，給其糧使守。諸將並諫，璜曰：「霍弋已死，不能救稷等必矣，可須其日滿，然後受降，使彼得無罪，我受有義，內訓百姓，外懷鄰國，不亦可乎！」稷等期訖糧盡，救兵不至，乃納之。修則既為毛炅所殺，則子允隨璜南征，城既降，允求復仇，璜不許。炅密謀襲璜，事覺，收炅，呵曰：「晉賊！」炅厲聲曰：「吳狗！何等為賊？」允剖其腹，曰：「復能作賊不？」炅猶罵曰：「吾志殺汝孫皓，汝父何死狗也！」璜既擒稷等，並送之。稷至合浦，發病死。孟幹、爨能、李松等至建鄴，皓將殺之。或勸皓，幹等忠於所事，宜宥之以勸邊將，皓從其言，將徙之臨海。幹等志欲北歸，慮東徙轉遠，以吳人愛蜀側竹弩，言能作之，皓留付作部。後幹逃至京都，松、能為皓所殺。幹陳伐吳之計，帝乃厚加賞賜，以為日南太守。先是，以楊稷為交州刺史，毛炅為交阯太守，印緩未至而敗，即贈稷交州，炅及松能子並關內侯。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-057-tao-huang:p003:m0157","object_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-057-tao-huang:p003:m0146"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"同段明說修則被毛炅所殺與子允求復仇。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false},{"id":"a-wu048-yun-father","subject_person_id":"wce_220_oey","object_person_id":"x82_2nn_rsk","predicate":"father","qualifiers":{"source_term":"則子允"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-048","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-048-sun-hao","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-048-sun-hao-ws2085142","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-048-sun-hao:p021","quote":"《漢晉春秋》曰：初霍弋遣楊稷、毛炅等戍，與之誓曰：「若賊圍城，未百日而降者，家屬誅；若過百日而城沒者，刺史受其罪。」稷等日未滿而糧盡，乞降於璜。璜不許，而給糧使守。吳人並諫，璜曰：「霍弋已死，無能來者，可須其糧盡，然後乃受，使彼來無罪，而我取有義，內訓吾民，外懷鄰國，不亦可乎！」稷、炅糧盡，救不至，乃納之。　華陽國志曰：稷，犍爲人。炅，建寧人。稷等城中食盡，死亡者半，將軍王約反降，吳人得入城，獲稷、炅，皆囚之。孫皓使送稷下都，稷至合浦，歐血死。晉追贈交州刺史。初，毛炅與吳軍戰，殺前部督脩則。陶璜等以炅壯勇，欲赦之。而則子允固求殺炅，炅亦不爲璜等屈，璜等怒，靣縛炅詰之，曰：「晉兵賊！」炅厲聲曰：「吳狗，何等爲賊？」吳人生剖其腹，允割其心肝，罵曰：「庸復作賊？」炅猶罵不止，曰：「尚欲斬汝孫皓，汝父何死狗也！」乃斬之。晉武帝聞而哀矜，即詔使炅長子襲爵，餘三子皆關內侯。此與漢晉春秋所說不同。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-048-sun-hao:p021:m0263","object_person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-048-sun-hao:p021:m0245"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"依固定見證同段親屬原詞及所屬敘事。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-057-tao-huang:p003:m0157","surface":"允","start":157,"end":158,"person_id":"wce_220_oey","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-057-tao-huang:p003","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-057-tao-huang"},{"id":"c-jinshu-057-tao-huang:p003:m0167","surface":"允","start":167,"end":168,"person_id":"wce_220_oey","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-057-tao-huang:p003","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-057-tao-huang"},{"id":"c-jinshu-057-tao-huang:p004:m0139","surface":"修允","start":139,"end":141,"person_id":"wce_220_oey","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-057-tao-huang:p004","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-057-tao-huang"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-048-sun-hao:p021:m0263","surface":"允","start":263,"end":264,"kind":"person","person_id":"wce_220_oey","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-048-sun-hao:p021","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-048-sun-hao"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-048-sun-hao:p036:m0014","surface":"脩允","start":14,"end":16,"kind":"person","person_id":"wce_220_oey","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-048-sun-hao:p036","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-048-sun-hao"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-048-sun-hao:p036:m0020","surface":"允","start":20,"end":21,"kind":"person","person_id":"wce_220_oey","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-048-sun-hao:p036","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-048-sun-hao"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-048-sun-hao:p036:m004