jh","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-048-sun-hao:p021:m0234","surface":"毛炅","start":234,"end":236,"kind":"person","person_id":"s9b_8tl_ce1","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-048-sun-hao:p021:m0245","surface":"脩則","start":245,"end":247,"kind":"person","person_id":"x82_2nn_rsk","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-048-sun-hao:p021:m0252","surface":"炅","start":252,"end":253,"kind":"person","person_id":"s9b_8tl_ce1","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-048-sun-hao:p021:m0261","surface":"則","start":261,"end":262,"kind":"person","person_id":"x82_2nn_rsk","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-048-sun-hao:p021:m0263","surface":"允","start":263,"end":264,"kind":"person","person_id":"wce_220_oey","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-048-sun-hao:p021:m0267","surface":"炅","start":267,"end":268,"kind":"person","person_id":"s9b_8tl_ce1","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-048-sun-hao:p021:m0269","surface":"炅","start":269,"end":270,"kind":"person","person_id":"s9b_8tl_ce1","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-048-sun-hao:p021:m0283","surface":"炅","start":283,"end":284,"kind":"person","person_id":"s9b_8tl_ce1","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-048-sun-hao:p021:m0295","surface":"炅","start":295,"end":296,"kind":"person","person_id":"s9b_8tl_ce1","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-048-sun-hao:p021:m0333","surface":"炅","start":333,"end":334,"kind":"person","person_id":"s9b_8tl_ce1","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-048-sun-hao:p021:m0346","surface":"孫皓","start":346,"end":348,"kind":"person","person_id":"05e_9bb_55a","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-048-sun-hao:p021:m0372","surface":"炅","start":372,"end":373,"kind":"person","person_id":"s9b_8tl_ce1","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-048-sun-hao","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-048","work_id":"w-sanguozhi","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-048-sun-hao-ws2085142"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-048-sun-hao:p036","text":"三年夏，郭馬反。馬本合浦太守脩允部曲督。允轉桂林太守，疾病，住廣州，先遣馬將五百兵至郡安撫諸夷。允死，兵當分給，馬等累世舊軍，不樂離別。皓時又科實廣州戶口，馬與部曲將何典、王族、吳述、殷興等因此恐動兵民，合聚人衆，攻殺廣州督虞授。馬自號都督交廣二州諸軍事、安南將軍，興廣州刺史，述南海太守。典攻蒼梧，族攻始興。八月，以軍師張悌爲丞相，牛渚都督何植爲司徒。執金吾滕循爲司空，未拜，轉鎮南將軍，假節領廣州牧，率萬人從東道討馬，與族遇於始興，未得前。馬殺南海太守劉略，逐廣州刺史徐旗。皓又遣徐陵督陶濬將七千人從西道，命交州牧陶璜部伍所領及合浦、鬱林諸郡兵，當與東西軍共擊馬。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":86,"last_line":86,"raw_start":13927,"raw_end":14310,"raw_character_offsets":[13934,13935,13936,13937,13938,13939,13940,13941,13942,13943,13944,13945,13946,13947,13948,13949,13950,13951,13952,13953,13954,13955,13956,13957,13958,13959,13960,13961,13962,13963,13964,13965,13966,13967,13968,13969,13970,13971,13972,13973,13974,13975,13976,13977,13978,13979,13980,13981,13982,13983,13984,13985,13986,13987,13988,13989,13990,13991,13992,13993,13994,13995,13996,13997,13998,13999,14000,14001,14002,14003,14004,14005,14006,14007,14008,14009,14010,14011,14012,14013,14014,14015,14016,14017,14018,14019,14020,14021,14022,14023,14024,14025,14026,14027,14028,14029,14030,14031,14032,14033,14034,14035,14036,14037,14038,14039,14040,14041,14042,14043,14044,14045,14046,14047,14048,14049,14050,14051,14052,14053,14054,14055,14056,14057,14058,14059,14060,14061,14062,14063,14064,14065,14066,14067,14068,14069,14070,14071,14072,14073,14074,14075,14076,14077,14078,14079,14080,14081,14082,14083,14084,14085,14086,14087,14088,14181,14182,14183,14184,14185,14186,14187,14188,14189,14190,14191,14192,14193,14194,14195,14196,14197,14198,14199,14200,14201,14202,14203,14204,14205,14206,14207,14208,14209,14210,14211,14212,14213,14214,14215,14216,14217,14218,14219,14220,14221,14222,14223,14224,14225,14226,14227,14228,14229,14230,14231,14232,14233,14234,14235,14236,14237,14238,14239,14240,14241,14242,14243,14244,14245,14246,14247,14248,14249,14250,14251,14252,14253,14254,14255,14256,14257,14258,14259,14260,14261,14262,14263,14264,14265,14